[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]

; Dry-storage shelf: the plain "bookcaseClosed" model (the same one the shelf
; station uses) with two small piles of bread on every shelf board, so a storage
; shelf reads as stocked from the game camera. Every child is a Kenney model
; used as-is; the whole prop is scaled by 2 at runtime (FurnitureDef.scale_mult),
; so the food-kit children sit at 0.33 = the game's own food size (0.7 world).
;
; Native kit units: the bookcase is 0.40 x 0.85 x 0.25 and its open front faces
; +Z (towards the game camera). The boards' top surfaces are at y = 0.13 / 0.37
; / 0.61 and the clear interior is x 0.04..0.36, z -0.21..-0.02. Every bread
; slice stays inside that box (front of the shelf, so the shelf above does not
; hide it at a 50 degree camera pitch), so the piece still measures 1x1 cells
; after the x2 scale.

